## What This Teaching Does

Appends a high-impact signal to `WAI-Signals.jsonl` on this spoke.

**Affects:** `wai-shipit.md` Step 1 (framework sync)
**Implication:** `templates/spoke/commands/` is now auto-synced alongside `.claude/commands/` on every shipit — eliminates 3-file manual sync workaround
**Challenge Solved:** Recurring manual copy of wai*.md to spoke templates appeared as workaround_churn in 7 of 12 sessions (vector-03)

